    "content": { "title": null, "text": "We've been using Taggbox for quite some time now, and it's been a great experience overall. The platform is very easy to use, which makes managing and showcasing our social proof simple and effective. What really stands out is the support team they're always quick to help whenever we have questions or need assistance. A special thanks to our Success Manager, Thakur Pratap, who has consistently been there for us and has always made sure our queries are resolved promptly. We're genuinely happy with Taggbox and would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for an easy and reliable way to display social proof on their website." },
